# A spread of effects and adjustments on a 4 MP layer.
doc 2400 1600
noise 5 random
adjust brightness-contrast 20 30
adjust hue-sat 30 120 0
adjust curves-lum 0:0,64:100,190:170,255:255
effect gaussian 12
effect motion 30 20 1
effect median 4 50
effect unfocus 6
effect oil 3 50
effect twist 45 0.8 0 0 2
effect waves Ripples 20 5 0 0 0 2
effect clouds 200 0.6 3 000000 FFFFFF Overlay
effect stained 16 2 70 4 1 202020
effect halftone Cmyk 6 0 000000 FFFFFF
effect glow 6 10 10
